    "title": "Cryptogram Words Master",
    "description": "Allow us to introduce a brand new word puzzle game that will challenge your mind! Meet an amazing word puzzle game - strain your brain with Cryptogram Words Master! \r\n\r\nInside Cryptogram Words Master we have prepared cool riddles and puzzles for you.\r\n\r\nIn each level you will find a hidden phrase. Start spelling it out. Once you complete the task, you will learn an interesting fact. To make it more fun for you to play, in the Cryptogram Words Master we have collected for you a lot of  wise thoughts of famous people and cool facts from different areas.\r\n\r\nWith the Cryptogram Words Master you get a lot of fun, relax and learn a lot of interesting things.\r\n\r\nSit back and play the word riddle. From level to level you will enjoy exciting word puzzles. Each word puzzle is more interesting than the previous one. Forget about boring crossword puzzles, word search or sudoku. In Cryptogram Words Master everything is much more fun.\r\n\r\nThere is nothing better than playing a game, training your brain, practicing logic and getting smarter at the same time. Now it's all available in the addictive word game Cryptogram Words Master!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Allow us to introduce a brand new word puzzle game that will challenge your mind! Meet an amazing word puzzle game - strain your brain with Cryptogram Words Master! <br><br>Inside Cryptogram Words Master we have prepared cool riddles and puzzles for you.<br><br>In each level you will find a hidden phrase. Start spelling it out. Once you complete the task, you will learn an interesting fact. To make it more fun for you to play, in the Cryptogram Words Master we have collected for you a lot of  wise thoughts of famous people and cool facts from different areas.<br><br>With the Cryptogram Words Master you get a lot of fun, relax and learn a lot of interesting things.<br><br>Sit back and play the word riddle. From level to level you will enjoy exciting word puzzles. Each word puzzle is more interesting than the previous one. Forget about boring crossword puzzles, word search or sudoku. In Cryptogram Words Master everything is much more fun.<br><br>There is nothing better than playing a game, training your brain, practicing logic and getting smarter at the same time. Now it&#39;s all available in the addictive word game Cryptogram Words Master!",
